  "source_quotes": {
    "r1-task": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 23,
      "text": "影音任務問「聲音響起時畫面是圓還是方」：每個情境只移動聲音形成兩題，兩題皆答對才算一個配對成功，事前選定模型為200／200。有限音型生成則按指定頻率、次序、時值與停頓判整段音型，200／200通過；換波形內容的影音診斷仍有失敗。"
    },
    "r1-c2": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 23,
      "text": "該批C-v2從候選動作中選答案（Choice），60題答對39題；固定規則接受其中53題，裡面19題答錯，未達升版門檻，當時保留研究候選及舊版預設。"
    },
    "r1-version": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 25,
      "text": "目前裝置決策推薦使用後續完成的[19.25：C-v3](course/chapters/19.md#19.25)。"
    },
    "r3-command": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 113,
      "text": "python scripts/check_course_models.py --model text_foundation"
    },
    "r3-input": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 116,
      "text": "第一條只列清單，不下載。第二條匿名下載文字模型`text_foundation`、核對檔案並在CPU上推論，不必另給題目：它先用固定起始token核對各權重的前向計算，再按公開清單用文字提示`color=blue;shape=circle;`生成。本次該提示得到`side=right.`；這筆輸入與回答保存於檢查報告，不把它當成整體正確率。"
    },
    "r3-output": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 121,
      "text": "{\"model\": \"text_foundation\", \"status\": \"passed\"}"
    },
    "r3-success": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 124,
      "text": "`status`為`passed`且命令正常結束，表示檔案核對、載入與CPU執行都通過；若是`failed`，先查看錯誤訊息與`evidence`報告。正常結束的exit code（結束碼）為0：macOS／Linux在該命令後立即輸入`echo $?`查看，PowerShell用`$LASTEXITCODE`。"
    },
    "r3-limit": {
      "page_id": "readme",
      "source": "README.md",
      "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v21/sources/readme.md",
      "source_sha256": "be92d9828a3bf551fc459348770468ba62f34d390c1e2e66b95e2bd8cee487a5",
      "line": 124,
      "text": "這是檔案與執行通路的檢查；回答是否正確要看對應實驗在驗證與測試題上的評估。"
    },
